Z||000002||ThatRickGuy||06-22-2000||11:30 PM||||so much for a trunk! there's not even room for the "Three grocery bags" as advertised! I think the power would be sweet as hell, but what about handling loss? Just swapping to a 3.4 shifts the weight balance to 45/55, unless it's an aluminum block and heads, I'd be worried about some serious push in the corners... maybe if you stcuk a bag of cement mix in the hood and some heavier springs....||||reg||1
